==Latin==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ine-pro|la}} {{m|ine-pro||*gʷr̥Htos}}, {{m|ine-pro|*gʷerH-||to welcome, greet, praise}}. Cognates include {{etyl|sa|-}} {{m|sa|गृणाति|tr=gṛṇā́ti||to praise}}, {{etyl|cu|-}} {{m|cu|жрьти|tr=žrĭti}} and {{etyl|prg|-}} {{m|prg|girtwei||to praise}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-pronunc|grātus}}

===Adjective===
{{la-adj-1&2|grātus|grata|grāta|gratum|grātum}}

# [[pleasing]], [[acceptable]], [[agreeable]], [[welcome]]
# [[dear]], [[beloved]]
# [[grateful]], [[thankful]]

